{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"ALSA-2026:23360","published":"2026-06-04T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-06-05T12:45:04.010490284Z","related":["CVE-2026-3039","CVE-2026-5946"],"summary":"Important: bind9.16 security update","details":"The Berkeley Internet Name Domain (BIND) is an implementation of the Domain Name System (DNS) protocols. BIND includes a DNS server (named); a resolver library (routines for applications to use when interfacing with DNS); and tools for verifying that the DNS server is operating correctly.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * bind: BIND 9 server memory exhaustion during GSS-API TKEY negotiation (CVE-2026-3039)\n  * bind: BIND: Denial of Service via specially crafted DNS messages (CVE-2026-5946)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"bind9.16","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind9.16"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.16.23-0.22.el8_10.6"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:23360.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind9.16-chroot","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind9.16-chroot"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.16.23-0.22.el8_10.6"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:23360.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind9.16-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bind9.16-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"32:9.16.23-0.22.el8_10.6"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:23360.json"}},{"package":{"name":"bind9.16-dnssec-utils","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","p